ed to combat hair thinning and early-stage hair loss. Using autologous micrografts derived from the patient\'s own scalp tissue, Regenera activates dormant hair follicles, improves scalp health, and stimulates natural hair regrowth.\\\\r\\\\nKey Benefits:\\\\r\\\\nEffective for androgenetic alopecia and thinning hair\\\\r\\\\nUses the body\\u2019s own regenerative cells \\u2014 100% natural\\\\r\\\\nSafe, quick, and minimally invasive procedure\\\\r\\\\nVisible improvements in hair density and quality\\\\r\\\\nNo downtime, suitable for both men and women\\\\r\\\\nRegenera offers a natural, science-backed solution for fuller, healthier hair.\\\"}\"}'),(1049,'9ed63d91-702b-4810-9e3e-e0780753c36e',1,'Create','App\\Models\\Device',16,'App\\Models\\Device',16,'App\\Models\\Device',16,'','finished','','2025-05-05 07:25:31','2025-05-05 07:25:31',NULL,'{\"title\":{\"uk\":\"Dermalux LED Phototherapy\",\"en\":null},\"description\":{\"uk\":\"Dermalux LED Phototherapy\\r\\n\\r\\nDermalux is an advanced LED light therapy system that uses clinically proven wavelengths to treat a range of skin concerns \\u2014 safely, painlessly, and without downtime.\\r\\n\\r\\nKey Benefits:\\r\\n\\r\\nBlue Light: Fights acne-causing bacteria\\r\\n\\r\\nRed Light: Boosts collagen and reduces inflammation\\r\\n\\r\\nNear-Infrared Light: Speeds up healing and calms the skin\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nSuitable for all skin types, Dermalux can be used on its own or combined with other treatments for enhanced results.\\r\\n\\r\\nReveal clearer, healthier, more radiant skin with Dermalux.\",\"ru\":\"Dermalux LED \\u2013 \\u0421\\u0432\\u0435\\u0442\\u043e\\u0442\\u0435\\u0440\\u0430\\u043f\\u0438\\u044f \\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u043f\\u043e\\u043a\\u043e\\u043b\\u0435\\u043d\\u0438\\u044f\\r\\nDermalux \\u2014 \\u044d\\u0442\\u043e \\u043f\\u0435\\u0440\\u0435\\u0434\\u043e\\u0432\\u0430\\u044f \\u0441\\u0438\\u0441\\u0442\\u0435\\u043c\\u0430 LED-\\u0441\\u0432\\u0435\\u0442\\u043e\\u0442\\u